    2. choose 2-3 corners from {TL, TR, BL, BR}
    3. assign each chosen corner a distinct non-zero color from 1-9
    4. place marker pixels at chosen corners on an otherwise all-zero grid
  validation: run solver to produce output; verify output has >=2 distinct colored regions
